+/// tmux bracket every repaint frame with hide/show, which makes these the
+/// only reliable "frame starting" / "frame settled" signals in the byte
+/// stream: captured from a real tmux scroll-back, the final repaint that
+/// brings content back into view is followed by nothing but DECSET 25 -
